{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"namespaces","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/XestiXML\/documentation\/XestiXML\/XMLFormatter\/Namespace","preciseIdentifier":"s:8XestiXML12XMLFormatterV9NamespaceV","text":"Namespace","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/XestiXML\/documentation\/XestiXML\/XMLNode"},{"type":"text","text":" tree records namespace URIs, never prefixes, so the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"formatter chooses the prefixes. Every declaration is written on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"root element, and this option says what those declarations are. It"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"need not be exhaustive, and it is empty by default."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A URI not listed here is still written correctly. It becomes the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"default namespace if "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"every","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" element in the tree carries it;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"otherwise it receives a generated prefix ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ns1"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ns2"},{"type":"text","text":", and so on)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"assigned in document order. So a document using a single namespace"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"throughout needs no configuration at all."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The prefix "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"xml"},{"type":"text","text":" is bound to the XML namespace permanently and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"implicitly. It need not be declared, and cannot be bound to any other"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"URI."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note that "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/XestiXML\/documentation\/XestiXML\/XMLFormatter\/Error\/invalidNamespace(_:_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" is thrown if a prefix is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not a valid XML name without a colon, if a URI is empty, or if the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same prefix or the same URI is bound twice."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/XestiXML\/documentation\/XestiXML\/XMLFormatter\/Options-swift.struct\/namespaces","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/xestixml\/xmlformatter\/options-swift.struct\/namespaces"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/XestiXML\/documentation\/XestiXML","doc:\/\/XestiXML\/documentation\/XestiXML\/XMLFormatter","doc:\/\/XestiXML\/documentation\/XestiXML\/XMLFormatter\/Options-swift.struct"]]},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"XestiXML"}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"namespaces","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Namespace","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8XestiXML12XMLFormatterV9NamespaceV"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"externalID":"s:8XestiXML12XMLFormatterV7OptionsV10namespacesSayAC9NamespaceVyxq__GGvp","symbolKind":"property","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property","title":"namespaces"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The prefixes to bind to the namespace URIs appearing in the XML node","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tree.","